Repalce `{% qurl request.get_full_path ... %}` template tags to Django 5.2's built-in `{% querystring %}` tag and removed `{% load qurl %}` for the following searches:

- atimap
- cafcip
- datastrategy
- nap5
- nap6

Also fixed double-slash (`//record/`) URL concatenation on the `nap6` search.
